SUMMARY:ADI GLOBAL DISTRIBUTION FUNDING LLC — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: ADI GLOBAL DISTRIBUTION FUNDING LLC\nRoadshow: https://www.netroad
 show.com/events/login/1PeTHmojClRSp7xh3o4MBNHZ7uzUknaFtf1E3\n\nDeal contex
 t:\nADI Escrow Issuer LLC (ultimate issuer: ADI Global Distribution Fundin
 g LLC) is bringing a $500 million 8-year Senior Notes offering in connecti
 on with the planned spin-off of Resideo's ADI Global Distribution business
  into an independent public company. The deal is structured as NC-3 with a
  first call at par plus 50% of the coupon\, and proceeds will be used alon
 gside concurrent Senior Secured Credit Facilities to fund a ~$900 million 
 one-time cash dividend to Resideo as partial consideration for the contrib
 ution of ADI's assets and liabilities. The transaction is distributed as 1
 44A/Reg S for life with an investor call on June 15th and pricing expected
  the following day.
